Card front artwork — packages/spanish-deck-ui/assets/fronts/*.webp
==================================================================

These 40 files are NOT covered by the license of the rest of this
repository. They are a derivative work and carry their own terms.

Original artwork
  Basquetteur, via Wikimedia Commons
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Spanish_playing_cards

Distributed as SVG by
  https://github.com/gjenkins20/spanish-playing-cards-svg

License
  Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Changes made
  1. The source SVGs were rasterized to WebP at 329x520.
  2. The face background was completed. In 36 of the 40 source files the
     face fill does not span the whole card, leaving part of it transparent
     -- on the as de espada from x=211 of 329, on the doce de oro from x=46.
     The missing area is filled with a continuation of the face's own
     eight-band gradient, and the rounded corners are restored afterwards.

  Nothing else was altered: no retouch, no recolour, no crop. The exact
  recipe is ../tools/process-svg-deck.mjs.

ShareAlike
  Because rasterizing is an adaptation, these WebP files are themselves
  licensed CC BY-SA 3.0. Anyone redistributing them must keep this notice,
  credit Basquetteur, link the license, and state that changes were made.
  The attribution the product itself shows lives in ../src/about.ts.
